EXAMPLES LICENSE
================

The example scripts in this directory are sample documents shipped to demonstrate
the .mangaplay format. They are NOT covered by the LICENSE in the parent
extension-mangaplay-spec/ directory.

Each script is a creative work owned by its author. Reading the file as a
reference for the format is permitted. Copying, redistributing, performing,
adapting, or otherwise exploiting the *content* of these scripts requires the
author's separate permission.

