What this means in practice
---------------------------

You MAY:
  - Read the scripts to understand the .mangaplay format
  - Use them as input fixtures for parser/renderer testing
  - Quote short excerpts in spec documentation, articles, or reviews

You MAY NOT, without written permission from the author:
  - Republish the scripts in whole or in substantial part
  - Produce derivative works (adaptations, translations, remixes, sequels)
  - Distribute drawn/illustrated/animated versions
  - Use the characters, settings, or plot in your own works
